{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt for the Six Super Artifacts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bend reality. Dash through fast levels, unlock strange dimensions, and piece together a living treasure map that points to the biggest secret of all, a new perspective on the actual meaning of Life, and your place within this Universe, and what happens after you go to the other side. This is the truth you have always been seeking. <strong>(FULL STORY NOT AVAILABLE IN DEMO)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/efaf649658e9251b48bbdc653509f492.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/efaf649658e9251b48bbdc653509f492.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Multi-Dimensional Quest</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where every corner hides a map fragment, every fragment opens new routes, and every route leads to hundreds of ancient artifacts with a story to tell. Each artifact adds a piece of the puzzle, from old empires to star-touched myths. Explore at your own pace across a giant treasure map Overworld, pick a pin, jump into the level behind it, and come back with a new piece that expands the map itself. Let the map trace who you are. Each new route brings you closer to the Six Super Artifacts that change how you play; and how you see. The more fragments you collect, the more the map opens up; the more the lore speaks back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/961d2c602e586791751085f49a86621e.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/961d2c602e586791751085f49a86621e.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect-to-Gain Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No upgrade menus; pick up map fragments or artifacts and your player improves on the spot. Thousands of tiny boosts mean every find matters, even the smallest shard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/3c10dcb5a7e9dbdb18f44105b79b783a.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/3c10dcb5a7e9dbdb18f44105b79b783a.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Treasure-Map Overworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect map fragments to expand the map and reveal fresh routes, secrets, and shortcuts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which pins to chase next, use portals to traverse to desert dunes, deep seas, icy slides, jungle tangles, and more, portal jumping to find shortcuts to each worlds Super Artifact. (Desert Dunes available in Demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts you find unlock memories, myths, and cosmic hints tailored to the path you pick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surge &amp; Rage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst ahead with Surge, hold the line with Rage, and upgrade powers tied to each Super Artifact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top-Down Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic exploration with modern feel, unlock abilities, open shortcuts, and master tricky chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Living Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement adds notes to world themes, building a Haunting soundtrack that follows your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/f4041714369d8f75693cdc57532c0581.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/f4041714369d8f75693cdc57532c0581.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tone with Teeth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark-fantasy charm, dry humor, and an optional in-game novel for deep-lore treasure hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/a9051ddc7e2dd23d7b295fa88f2b3a42.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/a9051ddc7e2dd23d7b295fa88f2b3a42.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solo or Chat-Plays</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite your live viewers to throw fun challenges via simple chat commands. (Chat Plays is Disabled in DEMO)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/3ebfc7cdcb61e68e6560c699eca7e13e.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/3ebfc7cdcb61e68e6560c699eca7e13e.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Explorers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for players who love secrets, collectible hunting, and flexible routes to the finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/c38f284bb5ef282b19c130d70ab4a7af.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/c38f284bb5ef282b19c130d70ab4a7af.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035220?t=1759455529","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4035220?t=1759455529","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/7d88b7886073ea355db5d5be94c1cf2ae0f2b305/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759455529","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/7d88b7886073ea355db5d5be94c1cf2ae0f2b305/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759455529","categories":[{"descript