d.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/9d9ff9307e9de8445521b00fc0de18b3.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Non-Linear Adventure</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose which pins to chase next, use portals to traverse to desert dunes, deep seas, icy slides, jungle tangles, and more, portal jumping to find shortcuts to each worlds Super Artifact. (Desert Dunes available in Demo)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/7fb7e6781d3a5ef1f75958aa33f9cf57.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Storytelling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Artifacts you find unlock memories, myths, and cosmic hints tailored to the path you pick.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/0a882e68a9f8ff5128715b102375f11b.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surge &amp; Rage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Burst ahead with Surge, hold the line with Rage, and upgrade powers tied to each Super Artifact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/e68dcb8eb44d5f99114d89c1b2e7b955.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Top-Down Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic exploration with modern feel, unlock abilities, open shortcuts, and master tricky chambers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/4d7d60b42eb5308775f52ee3175e744e.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Living Soundtrack</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement adds notes to world themes, building a Haunting soundtrack that follows your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/f4041714369d8f75693cdc57532c0581.poster.avif?t=1759455529\" width=1074 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4035220/extras/f4041714369d8f75693cdc57532c0581.webm?t=1759455529\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Tone with Teeth</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark-fantasy charm, dry humor, and an optional in-game novel for deep-lore treasure hunters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class